          "text": "Reported back pain red flags"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports no leg weakness, numbness, paraesthesia, or saddle anaesthesia; no bowel or bladder incontinence or retention; no trauma or fall, fevers, weight loss, intravenous drug use, or history of malignancy."
      }
    },
